====Usage notes====
Unlike in english, when used refering to a negative proposition formerly asked, it is considered incorrect in french or colloquial to respond to such a question with the affirmative.
The dialogue "Je (ne) le supporte pas!" - "moi aussi" is here incorrect, "moi '''non plus'''" should be used instead.